    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Yo-ac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë took Yo-ac kuäär tëë kɛ run bärɔw, kä cuɛ ruëc kɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuaan kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Dhib-yaa kä Ber-cɛ-ba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ac la̱t ni gɔy nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kɛ ni̱n bo̱o̱thä palä ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da Yo-ac kuen män da̱ŋ rɛw, cuɛ tekɛ dhɔɔl kɛnɛ nyier.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mi tɔt cu Yo-ac ɛ lar i̱ bɛ luak Kuɔth Nhial bany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bööth palä kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay dol, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Wiaa rɛy ciëŋ Juda, duɔlɛ yio̱w kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, ti ba botni luak Kuɔth Nhial, Kuothdun run kä run. La̱tdɛ jɛ ɛn täämɛ.” Duundɛ ɣöö /ken ji̱ Lii-bay ɛ la̱t nikä kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär bo̱o̱th palä min di̱i̱t ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da cɔl, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu /ci ruac kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay ɔ, kɛ ɣöö dëë tho̱lbo̱k ëë ci Muthɛ ja̱ŋ Kuɔth Nhial ɛ thiec kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɛl wä thol ɔ kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ kui̱ luaak Kuɔth ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci gaat ciek ɛ puɔ̱ny duerɛ ni Ä-thɛ̈l-yaa luak Kuɔth thur, kä ca tin diaal tëë ca lɛy rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, wä pal ni kuoth Baal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ruac kua̱r, cua thanduk la̱t kä cua jɛ la̱th raar thok luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua ruac jäk kä rɛy cieŋ Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ ɣöö ba tho̱lbo̱k ëë ci Muthɛ ja̱ŋ Kuɔth ɛ kɔn thol kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɛy dɔaar nöŋ Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu lo̱c ruëëcni kɛ nɛy diaal tɛɛth, kä cukɛ tho̱lbo̱kdiɛn nööŋ, kä cua kɛ ben la̱th rɛy thandukä amäni mëë cɛ thia̱a̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mɔ ca thanduk nööŋ ji̱ kɔaar kua̱r ɔ rɛy luaak, mi cikɛ jɛ ŋa̱c i̱ te yio̱w ti ŋuan thi̱n, la bulkamiin kua̱r kɛnɛ bulkamiin bo̱o̱thä palä min di̱t, a bëë, ba yio̱w ben woc thi̱n, kä ba luɔc guäthdɛ. Kä la kɛn a lät ni ciaŋ, cukɛ yio̱w ti ŋuan thol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär kɛnɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da kɛ ka̱m nɛy tin ca ka̱m la̱t luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kä cukɛ ta̱a̱th kɛ ŋa̱a̱t jiɛn kɛ bel kɔk, kɛ ɣöö ba luak Kuɔth Nhial bany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛy tëë la̱t kɛ jɛ, cua la̱t tit, kä cu la̱t wä agɔaa. Cukɛ luak Kuɔth luɔc ni tääkädɛ mëë wal, a bɛ buɔ̱m ɛ tët. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cikɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ ba̱ny luaak, cukɛ duɔth yio̱o̱ni nöŋ kuäär kɛnɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da, kä cua kɛ wä lät ni kuak luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kuak la̱t kɛ nyin mucä min waŋkɛ kɛ thääk wal tin kuɔ̱r kuɔ̱ɔ̱r, kɛ kuak dääpä kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r. Kä thöpkɛ muc tin waŋkɛ ni ciaŋ rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial kɛ ni̱n teekä Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gër ca̱a̱pni Yo-ac kɛ rɔ̱",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da ca wut mi dɔaŋ mi tëë run ti ŋuan, cuɛ li̱w a tëë kɛ run ti kuɔ̱r wi̱cdɛ jiɛn diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɛ kony därwec Dee-bid rɛy kua̱ri, kɛ ɣöö cɛ ti gɔw la̱t kä I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ kui̱ Kuɔth kɛnɛ dhɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr li̱eth Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da, cu bööth Juda kuäär ben lät kä malɛ luthä. Kä cu kuäär kɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ luak Kuɔth Nhial Kuoth gua̱ni lo̱k. Kä cua wä pal ni kuoth Ä-ce-rim kɛnɛ kolaaŋ. Kä cu kɛ̈c Kuɔth ben kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ kui̱ dui̱rädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial gök jäk kä rɛydiɛn, kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛ wä juɔ̱c jɛ. Kä cäŋ ni mëë ca kɛ la̱t kɛn ti̱ti̱, /ken kɛn ɛ liŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yiëë Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Dhɛ-kar-yaa gat bo̱o̱thä palä ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da. Kä cuɛ rɔ cuŋ nhiam nath, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn min laar Kuoth ɛ i̱, ‘Ɛŋu /ci yɛn luëëkä luth ɔ? Mɔ cia wä nöŋ ni rɔ̱ riɛkɔ. Kɛ ɣöö cia Kuoth pa̱l ruëëc amäni yɛn cɛ yɛ pa̱l ruëëc.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cua lät kä mi jiääk, kä cua bök kɛ dööl amäni mëë cɛ li̱w rɛy kal luaak Kuɔth kɛ ruac kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu kuäär ciaaŋ ëë gɔaa ëë ca nyuɔ̱th jɛ ɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da pa̱l ruëëc. Kä cuɛ gatdɛ ni Dhɛ-kar-yaa jak kä bökɛ kɛ dööl. Kä min li̱w Dhɛ-kar-yaa, cuɛ wee, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ti lätdi ti mal lɛ nɛn, a bɛ ji̱ duäc!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Yo-ac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
